<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-044-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.184419" lon="-120.833204"><name>SC26-044-A</name><cmt>SC26-044</cmt><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 12.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 82/100; not catch probability. Center 62 ft; nearby 49–84 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-026</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 225-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.18388929705984" lon="-120.8312965627681"/><trkpt lat="35.18379919016338" lon="-120.83129895764472"/><trkpt lat="35.183807054004376" lon="-120.83173797497186"/><trkpt lat="35.18371694708031" lon="-120.83174036935395"/><trkpt lat="35.183718912785636" lon="-120.83185012359135"/><trkpt lat="35.183358485048444" lon="-120.83185970052968"/><trkpt lat="35.183352587712704" lon="-120.83153043930102"/><trkpt lat="35.18317237387435" lon="-120.83153522843223"/><trkpt lat="35.18316844184649" lon="-120.83131572148346"/><trkpt lat="35.18270870931069" lon="-120.83187681508502"/><trkpt lat="35.18242192476943" lon="-120.83277503891891"/><trkpt lat="35.18239159208525" lon="-120.83325783583992"/><trkpt lat="35.182491719269954" lon="-120.83397235723872"/><trkpt lat="35.182879821256314" lon="-120.8348122175044"/><trkpt lat="35.18350224696438" lon="-120.8354072544806"/><